% crossing in every bar (159, 161-165), with two sets of slurs, accents and staccatos and unison heads of different values at 162-163. In the score Ob 2 now has its own staff for these bars (staff "Oboe 2" in score.ly, hidden elsewhere), and the combined staff shows Ob 1 alone, labelled 1.;
% the part is unchanged except for ff espress. at 159, as in Vln II, which it doubles.
