% PDF 230 Schoenberg/Brahms Op. 25: solid chords, then arpeggiation; PDF 230-231 a countertheme with its own rhythm): 159-165 the clarinets hold the harmony (G-B-D-F | F/D, A flat/F over the N6, D/G at the 4-3)
% while Vln II + Ob 2 carry the only eighth-note line; their broken chords had duplicated the counter-line's figure in G4-C5. The clarinet eighths return at 166 as the counter-line ends.
